{"id":"tertercay","qid":"Q737240","category":"river","type":"hydronym","names":{"az":"Tərtərçay","ru":"Тертер","en":"Tartar"},"coordinates":[47.30619,40.4494],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":null,"regionSource":null,"admin":[],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Tərtərçay — Kür çayının sağ qoludur. Kəlbəcər, Bərdə və Tərtər rayonları ərazisindən axır.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Терте́р (азерб. Tərtər) — река в Азербайджане, правый приток Куры. Берёт начало и в верховьях протекает по Карабахскому нагорью (северо-восточная часть Армянского нагорья), в низовьях — по Кура-Араксинской низменности, где пересекается Карабахским каналом.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Tartar (Azerbaijani: Tərtərçay, Armenian: Թարթառ) is one of the tributaries of the Kura river located in Azerbaijan. It passes through the districts of Kalbajar, Barda and Tartar.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Togana_Ter-Ter_river_e-citizen.jpg/960px-Togana_Ter-Ter_river_e-citizen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Togana_Ter-Ter_river_e-citizen.jpg/960px-Togana_Ter-Ter_river_e-citizen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":600,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Togana_Ter-Ter_river_e-citizen.jpg","title":"Togana Ter-Ter river e-citizen.jpg","artist":"Moonsun1981","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q737240: Tartar","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q737240","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":